  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-01-title> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/position> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/KeyPoint> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-01> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-01> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Gerrit Renner, Instrumental Analytical Chemistry, University of Duisburg-Essen. Environmental Health 2026. SBR: local 15-standard fits; n = 3 replicates per sample; whiskers: descriptive standard error, not total uncertainty."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-01> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/position> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/KeyPoint> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "SBR: approximately 15.69 and 13.65 µg/mg. Three replicates each, local 15-standard fits. Descriptive standard errors only; no significance or treatment-efficiency inference."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-02> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/position> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/KeyPoint> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Synthetic illustration, not measured data. TIC: total-ion chromatogram. EIC: extracted-ion chromatogram. A candidate peak or fitted component is not chemical identity."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-04> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/position> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/KeyPoint> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-06> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-06> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "qPeaks: moving windows at several scales, local asymmetric models, then joint fitting across traces. Synthetic illustration only, not a qPeaks run. A fitted component is not chemical identity."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-06> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/position> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-07> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/KeyPoint> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-07> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-07> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Manual FIFO (first in, first out): 15 standards, one out and one in. Balanced display order is not chronology. No optimal-size or drift-correction claim; retain blanks and quality control."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-07> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/position> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-08> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/KeyPoint> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "SBR (styrene-butadiene rubber): approximately 15.69 and 13.65 µg/mg, three normalized replicates per sample. Local 15-standard fits; whiskers: descriptive standard error, not total uncertainty. No treatment-effect or significance claim."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/position> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
