  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-07> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Manual FIFO (first in, first out): 15 standards, one out and one in. Balanced display order is not chronology. No optimal-size or drift-correction claim; retain blanks and quality control."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-07> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasKeyPoint> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-07> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-07> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-source-brief> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-08> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "SBR (styrene-butadiene rubber): approximately 15.69 and 13.65 µg/mg, three normalized replicates per sample. Local 15-standard fits; whiskers: descriptive standard error, not total uncertainty. No treatment-effect or significance claim."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasKeyPoint> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-keypoint-08> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-08> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-source-brief> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-09> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "FAIR: Findable, Accessible, Interoperable, Reusable. Link meaning, identities, parameters, versions and calibration across every handoff. RDF alone does not provide complete FAIR compliance."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-09> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-source-brief> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-10> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-10> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Selected SHACL constraint: PeakVector output versus IntegerValue input fails; PeakVector input passes. Structural conformance is not successful execution or analytical correctness."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-10> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-source-brief> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-11> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-11> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-11> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Event integration: In development. Engine and pipelines: existing according to the speaker. Require a complete saved file; register report completion before storage. Not a live integration."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-11> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-source-brief> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-12> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/Interpretation> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-12> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/authoredResource> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-12> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/body> "Transparent processing transforms analytical signals into traceable evidence. Keep calibration traceable, decisions explicit and interfaces checkable. Thank you."@en .
  <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-statement-12> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/ontology/hasSource> <https://w3id.org/project-chemie-digital/resource/eh26-source-brief> .
}

